# Design System

## Token Source

All tokens are defined in `apps/web/src/index.css` inside `@theme { ... }` (Tailwind v4). Light theme overrides use `[data-theme="light"]`.

## Color Palette

| Token | Dark | Purpose |
|-------|------|---------|
| `surface-0` | `#050506` | Page background |
| `surface-1` | `#0a0a0c` | Modal/panel background |
| `surface-2` | `#111114` | Card/input background |
| `surface-3` | `#19191e` | Hover states |
| `surface-4` | `#222228` | Scrollbar, deeper hover |
| `border-subtle` | `#1e1e24` | Dividers, light borders |
| `border-default` | `#2a2a32` | Input/card borders |
| `border-strong` | `#3a3a44` | Emphasized borders |
| `text-primary` | `#ededf0` | Main text |
| `text-secondary` | `#8b8b96` | Labels, descriptions |
| `text-tertiary` | `#5a5a66` | Muted/hint text |
| `accent` | `#6366f1` | Brand color (indigo) |
| `success` | `#22c55e` | Success states |
| `warning` | `#eab308` | Warning states |
| `danger` | `#ef4444` | Error/danger states |

## Fonts

- Sans: `Inter` (body, UI)
- Mono: `JetBrains Mono` (code)

## Global Utility Classes

| Class | Purpose |
|-------|---------|
| `.glass` | Frosted glass effect (`backdrop-filter: blur(20px)`) |
| `.glow-accent` | Accent glow `box-shadow` |
| `.animate-shimmer` | Loading skeleton animation |
| `.animate-pulse-glow` | Pulsing opacity animation |
| `.markdown-body` | Rendered markdown content |
| `.vibe-datepicker` | Date picker theming |

## Rules

- Never use raw hex colors; always reference token classes (`text-text-primary`, `bg-surface-2`)
- New colors must be added to `@theme` first
- Keep dark/light parity: add any new token to both the default and `[data-theme="light"]` blocks
- **Whole-app look:** follow `visual-consistency.mdc` (always on) and `ui-chrome.mdc` for panels, lists, and Dock vs CommandBar.
